The original graphical prototype was preserved separately, while the assessed project was converted into a standard console application.

The conversion included:

- Moving the Visual Studio solution and project into `dev`.
- Removing Win32 startup and graphical dependencies from the assessed build.
- Removing Python dependencies.
- Rebuilding navigation, inventory, combat, map, Shimmer, and investigation interfaces for the console.
- Improving numeric input validation.
- Adding clear menu navigation and back actions.
- Creating a fresh-character progression path beginning at the Fountain.
- Preserving fixed first-clear bosses and separate post-clear farming encounters.
- Adding defeat review and Fountain recovery.
- Improving combat logs and player feedback.
- Adding console equipment management.
- Adding Shimmer loadout management.
- Completing the Floor I progression loop.

The archived graphical version remains in Git history, but it is not part of the final course build.

