## Equipment, Shimmer, and Artifact Systems

Later development focused heavily on the RPG progression systems.

### Equipment

The equipment system was expanded with:

- Weapon and armor slots.
- Multiple rarity levels.
- Main stats and substats.
- Item locking and discarding.
- Sorting and filtering.
- Pagination.
- Stat comparisons before equipping.
