### Shimmers

The final game includes:

- 31 Shimmer abilities.
- Unlock progression.
- Equip costs and loadout limits.
- Offensive and support skills.
- Cooldowns.
- Temporary buffs and debuffs.
- Damage-over-time interactions.
- Combat Shimmer selection.

Descriptions and runtime effects were audited so the displayed information matches the implemented behavior.

### Artifacts

The Artifact system includes:

- 15 unique Artifact effects.
- Artifact equipment.
- Artifact rarity drops.
- Three Artifact set families.
- Runtime set bonuses.
- Interactions with damage, healing, barriers, statuses, and other combat systems.

Deterministic regression tests were used to verify effects that would be difficult to obtain naturally during a normal playthrough.

